      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\[ 2.525252\\ldots=2+\\frac{52}{99}=\\frac{250}{99}. \\] This fraction is already in lowest terms, and \\(250+99=349.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
